      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Agentman 0.40.0

- **Everything in one app.** Agentman for Mac now carries `am` and sets it up on first launch. No terminal steps needed.
- **Updates itself.** The app checks for updates and installs them, and keeps `am serve` on the same version.
- **Stays matched.** When `am serve` is newer than the app, the app offers to update, or does it automatically if you ask it to.]]></description>
